{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614","id":3229800699,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6e27dM","number":108614,"title":"GDExtension: Prevent compatibility breakage from change to `ClassDB::instantiate()` for unexposed classes","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-07-14T19:30:54Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T20:01:08Z","closed_at":"2025-07-23T18:37:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108614.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-23T18:37:59Z"},"body":"In PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440 we changed `ClassDB::instantiate()` to prevent creating classes that are unexposed\r\n\r\nI don't think this was never intended to work. Unexposed classes defined within Godot that are unregistered (which is all of them) cannot be instantiated from `ClassDB::instantiate()`. Unexposed classes defined in a GDExtension are intended to work just like unexposed classed defined in Godot, however, in Godot 4.3 and 4.4, it is actually possible to instantiate them via `ClassDB::instantiate()`.\r\n\r\nFrom the perspective of GDExtension, this behavior change (despite being a fix) is actually a compatibility breakage if an extension depended on creating unexposed classes via `ClassDB::instantiate()`.\r\n\r\nThis PR prevents that compatibility breakage by adding a new `classdb_register_extension_class5()` that honors the `is_exposed` flag, and changes previous versions of that function to force that flag to `true`. This way older extensions that depended on the incorrect behavior of `ClassDB::instantiate()` should continue to work without issues, although, their unexposed classes will become exposed when the extension is loaded in Godot 4.5+\r\n\r\nI'm not sure this is actually a good idea :-)\r\n\r\nWhile we're aware of [one extension](https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator) that depends on the old behavior, my gut feeling is that most GDExtensions that use internal classes do not depend on this, and this change will simply make all their unexposed classes become exposed (which won't break anything, but would be annoying) until they upgrade to the new function and hence opt in to the new behavior\r\n\r\n**So, the question is:**\r\n\r\n1. Do we go with this PR to preserve compatibility, even though not many extensions depend on the incorrect behavior, and it will have annoying side effects?\r\n2. Or, do we say this breakage is acceptable, and leave things as they are?\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1818 for the godot-cpp changes, which include additions to the tests to verify that unexposed classes registered from GDExtension work as expected","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108614/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}